    "title_gu": "Conservation of Flora and Fauna",
    "body": "Due to excessive exploitation of plants and animal resources by human beings, the ecosystem has been disturbed. To protect the flora and fauna, the government has taken many steps such as setting up National Parks, Wildlife Sanctuaries, and Biosphere Reserves."
  },
